IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0031.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY FRD0031C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==CU==.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> MANUAL REVIEW FLAG
    05 FR-FLG             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
