2000-CHECK-MINOR.
    *> HIGH-VALUE TRANSACTION BY MINOR - LIMIT 13 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF CU-WS-CAGE LESS THAN 18 AND CU-T-AMT1 > 10000
        MOVE 'Y' TO FR-FLG
    END-IF.
